  unitName: Faetouched Sidonie
  unitId: 850928
  unitNumber: 8635
  description: "As elusive as they are rare, changelings are variously said to be
    the punishment of indiscretion, the product of supernatural mishap, or even a
    stolen child of the Fae. Whatever they are, most keep out of sight, and for good
    reason\u2014unscrupulous humans abduct them as slaves or worse due to their innate
    talents for illusion and bewitching.The unfortunate result of a scandalous liaison
    between a noblewoman and an amorous Fae, Sidonie's ruby sclera was enough to
    identify her as one of the fair folk, but her appearance too human for her father's
    people to bear her away to the Vale, rendering her an outcast between two worlds.Fearing
    a witch-hunt from her superstitious kinsmen, Sidonie's mother left her in the
    care of an apothecary, hoping the town's reputation for attracting Eastern traders\u2014a
    strange folk said to wield magics not unlike the Fae\u2014would help the child
    escape the bulk of the unwanted attention. Thus did Sidonie spend her formative
    years among Eastern mystics, but a persistent longing for *something* soon stirred
    in her heart. It was on her sixteenth birthday that she stole away on a caravan
    to carve out a niche in a world that seemed to both fear and love her.Mischievous
    curiosity was the bedrock for what would be well-remembered lessons in adulthood;
    after one too many close shaves, Sidonie learned to walk on the wild side. With
    clever glamours and illusory hexwork, Sidonie's reputation as an excellent infiltrator
    grew, and a single, star-crossed meeting with a wolf-eyed man would alter her
    course forever.But never did Sidonie think she would someday become the key that
    would entangle both the worlds in a spiral of love and hatred."
  summonDesc: Sure, I'll come along.<br>As long as there's something in it for me.
  fusionDesc: Oh, that could come in handy.<br>Let me guess, you "just happened"
    to come across it.<br>Nice.
  evoDesc: I was always meant to walk between humans and Fae...<br>I just didn't
    think it would be this way.
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
